<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE- Akzo Nobel Q2 net rises 25 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Akzo Nobel Q2 net rises 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ARNHEM, Netherlands 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter 1997</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				     459  vs  367</p>
<p>    Ditto per share (guilders)		6.44  vs  5.16</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			 6.19  vs  5.62</p>
<p>    Operating profit			     684  vs  545</p>
<p>    Tax						185  vs  135</p>
<p>    Financing charges				 69  vs   63</p>
<p>    Earnings from nonconsolidated cos	   40  vs   29</p>
<p>    Minorities					  11  vs    9</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast a net profit OF 375-427 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
